{"id":"moulin","lemma":"moulin","pos":"noun","rank":4684,"glosses":["mill; windmill","moulin","paradiddle"],"ipa":"/mu.lɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6f/Fr-moulin.ogg/Fr-moulin.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"moulins"},"formAudio":{"moulins":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-moulins.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est un moulin à parole.","en":"She is a chatterbox.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"speech, language"}]},{"text":"Une roue à eau actionne le moulin.","en":"A water wheel powers the mill.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"a wheel"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"to work","l":"actionner"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Il y a un moulin à vent sur la colline.","en":"There is a windmill on the hill.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"wind"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"hill, downs"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"]]},{"text":"On ne peut pas être au four et au moulin.","en":"You can't be in two places at once.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be"},null,null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to the"},null],"phrases":[[5,7,"in the oven"]]},{"text":"Les statistiques fournirent de l'eau à son moulin.","en":"The statistics gave ammunition to her argument.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"statistics"},{"g":"to supply","l":"fournir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]}]}